      "message": "test: check AddToBlockIndex keeps first-seen header on equal work\n\nBlockManager::AddToBlockIndex only replaces best_header when the new\nheader has strictly more chain work. Add a unit test that adds two\nsibling headers with equal work and checks that best_header keeps\npointing to the first one.",
